		(uuid "8b65f871-0cff-449b-ac10-1464efc843cb")
	)
	(text "Pin PB2 needs to be set to OUTPUT OPEN DRAIN such that\nit never attempts to drive the net high. It resets the H7 \nby driving low, but if not driving, the pull up 10k resistor\npulls up the net for us. If the G0 tries to drive the net \nhigh while the reset button is being pressed, there will be \na 0 impedence short the gnd i.e. vcc to gnd :( The current \ncould break the G0 or the H7, bad day. I placed a Schotky \ndiode in this circuit to prevent that happening in hardware\neven if the worst case. But just in case, don't risk it. "
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 232.918 31.242 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "99116327-4184-4552-9cff-e2fa0cbdd061")
	)
	(text "Configure these as Analog Mode pins to avoid unwated signal"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 142.494 70.104 0)
		(effects
